# Keep secrets, local state and build artefacts out of the build context/image.
# This file sits at the context root (src-tauri/) because the server image is
# built with the context one level above the server: the engine crate
# (battle-core) is a path dependency and has to be inside the context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/target
**/uploads
**/test_uploads_*
**/*.db
**/.git
**/.gitignore
server/SECURITY_FIXES_PROGRESS.md
